    {
      "id": "u_6fde1ee49671d33927eb150e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ library has been removed from the backend scripting API.",
      "sourceHash": "6fde1ee49671d33927eb150e91eae7b62281acb89d35dc232c811d998db8d724",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio",
      "contextHash": "d5047b4709e003330ec7e74235df313576d12c083a84fb93034eb9a7160ea091",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81a93aae7ba86db0b3c4c34c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Scripts that attempt to use __TRILIUM_PH_0__ will now throw an error with migration instructions.",
      "sourceHash": "81a93aae7ba86db0b3c4c34c45c6764b9342a4c004798ca0d48c02d137e2ad73",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio",
      "contextHash": "d5047b4709e003330ec7e74235df313576d12c083a84fb93034eb9a7160ea091",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_00f9d2b54afd26d0e622bf80_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Reasoning__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "00f9d2b54afd26d0e622bf80c6bb694f63780aaa4bc47b6190d74be29e46ba2a",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio > Reasoning",
      "contextHash": "37531d6145595b64453c7885c536c1d486d7980a7f5bfc8c5689d48454ee9ad4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea1f585fe5f57a96e14c9209_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ was deprecated in v0.103.0 in favor of __TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__node-html-parser__TRILIUM_PH_3__), which Trilium already uses for all of its own HTML parsing. The scripting API was the only place that still needed __TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "ea1f585fe5f57a96e14c9209ec7e5934d7ec45d3750d7ebef8a3deafb6e9a8c9",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio > Reasoning",
      "contextHash": "37531d6145595b64453c7885c536c1d486d7980a7f5bfc8c5689d48454ee9ad4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_167975262086749dd642b785_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Shipping both parsers was costly, because __TRILIUM_PH_0__ was loaded at startup on every platform. It added roughly 1.35 MB of bundled code to the server and desktop builds, and roughly 370 kB to the in-browser build, where it was loaded into the database worker before the application could start.",
      "sourceHash": "167975262086749dd642b785c76bc6488ca8ae625b364857057939ad783e07bc",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio > Reasoning",
      "contextHash": "37531d6145595b64453c7885c536c1d486d7980a7f5bfc8c5689d48454ee9ad4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_20fa45b6645bbb5f8810a9ca_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Migration__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "20fa45b6645bbb5f8810a9ca0051dce36dbe7a151999e844b1f5d0771b0d9f24",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio > Migration",
      "contextHash": "411b3a6c53519e62554e33a9df948249982b0d85d1af4ad8780dcd21b929dc53",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_83b334d40eabd0a948c01645_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Replace __TRILIUM_PH_0__ calls with __TRILIUM_PH_1__. Note that __TRILIUM_PH_2__ returns plain elements rather than a wrapped collection, so there is no __TRILIUM_PH_3__ object and no chaining.",
      "sourceHash": "83b334d40eabd0a948c0164595374f9da4a178c20654f0409fc0d3c59c5d1efd",
      "context": "v0.106.0: Removal of cheerio > Migration",
      "contextHash": "411b3a6c53519e62554e33a9df948249982b0d85d1af4ad8780dcd21b929dc53",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
